{"seq":3,"slug":"global-secondary-index-consistency","title":"全局二级索引建模与异步一致性维护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/relational-database-sharding-distributed-scaling/crossshard-query-distributed-transaction/global-secondary-index-consistency","wordCount":2787,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"全局二级索引建模与异步一致性维护\">全局二级索引建模与异步一致性维护</h1><p>当 <code>orders</code> 表按 <code>user_id</code> 分片后，<code>SELECT * FROM orders WHERE merchant_id = ?</code> 就失去了单一入口：<code>merchant_id</code> 不在分片键上，任何一台分片都只掌握「自己那部分订单」，扫描全部分片再归并是唯一能保证正确性的朴素做法。这类查询常占读流量三成以上，全分片散列（scatter-gather）把延迟拉到最慢分片的水平。<strong>全局二级索引（Global Secondary Index, GSI）</strong> 用一张独立分片、按新查询键组织的索引表，把「扫所有分片」变成「定位一个分片」。</p>\n<p>代价藏在维护里。GSI 是<strong>派生数据</strong>，主表分片与索引分片是两套规则，多数系统选择异步传播，于是二者之间存在一个<strong>一致性窗口</strong>。本文围绕这个窗口展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-局部索引的边界与全局索引的代价\">核心概念：局部索引的边界与全局索引的代价</h2><p>单库时代，二级索引是存储引擎的内部结构，索引项与数据行在同一棵 B+ 树上通过回表连接，事务提交时两者原子更新。分片把行按分片键打散后，「索引项与数据行同处一机」不再成立。</p>\n<p><strong>局部二级索引（local secondary index）</strong> 保持「索引跟数据走」：每个分片只索引自己持有的行，写入无跨节点协调。代价是查询通路被污染：查 <code>merchant_id</code> 时协调层不知道哪个分片有匹配行，只能向<strong>所有</strong>分片下发子查询再归并。设分片数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>、单分片 P99 延迟为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，则散列查询的尾延迟近似为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>scatter</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></munder><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>merge</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{scatter}} \\approx \\max_{i \\in [1,N]} L_i \\;+\\; T_{\\text{merge}}(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">scatter</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6493em;vertical-align:-0.966em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.309em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">[</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">]</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.966em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">merge</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>延迟由最慢分片与归并开销决定，与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 同阶增长；查询选择性再高也无法缩短它。</p>\n<p>判断标准很直接：<strong>如果新查询键上的读延迟不能用「加一个 GSI」换掉「扫 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个分片」，就不该建 GSI</strong>。局部索引 + 分片键前缀仍是同片查询，成本最低；只有当缺失分片键的查询足够频繁、且能接受一致性窗口时，GSI 才划算。取舍与分片键选择高度耦合，参见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../sharding-strategy-routing-model/sharding-key-selection-hotspot-avoidance\">分片键选择与热点规避</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>局部二级索引</th>\n<th>全局二级索引（GSI）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>索引分片依据</td>\n<td>随主表分片键</td>\n<td>独立按索引列分片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>点查命中分片数</td>\n<td>全部（散列）</td>\n<td>1（按索引键定位）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写维护成本</td>\n<td>分片内原子，无协调</td>\n<td>跨分片传播，需异步/两阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与主表一致性</td>\n<td>强（同事务）</td>\n<td>通常最终一致（有窗口）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"三种建模范式-通道表-覆盖索引表与物化视图\">三种建模范式：通道表、覆盖索引表与物化视图</h2><p>GSI 不是一种数据结构，而是建模选择，工程上常见三档，能力递增、维护成本也递增。</p>\n<p><strong>通道表（窄索引表 / index-as-table）</strong>：GSI 只有两列 <code>(index_key, primary_key)</code>，按 <code>index_key</code> 分片。查询分两步——先定位通道表分片拿到一批主键，再回主表做批量 <code>IN</code> 查询取整行（回表），等价于「把倒排表显式持久化」。Vitess 的 <strong>lookup vindex</strong> 是这一档的工业实现：按 <code>from</code>（被索引列值）分片的 lookup 表映射到 <code>to</code>（主键/分片键），VReplication 搬运主表变更（<a href=\"https://vitess.io/docs/\">vitess.io/docs — Lookup Vindex</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>覆盖索引表（projection / covering GSI）</strong>：索引表里冗余查询真正需要的列，命中后无需回表。DynamoDB 的 GSI 支持 <code>KEYS_ONLY</code> / <code>INCLUDE</code> / <code>ALL</code> 三种投影（<a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazondynamodb/latest/developerguide/GSI.html\">docs.aws.amazon.com — DynamoDB GSI</a>）：<code>KEYS_ONLY</code> 等价于通道表，<code>INCLUDE</code> 投影指定非键属性，<code>ALL</code> 投影全部。它用存储换一次网络跳转，适合「读多、列固定」的列表页；隐患也更大——冗余列是<strong>主表的副本</strong>，覆盖列越多、窗口越难收敛。</p>\n<p><strong>物化视图（聚合索引）</strong>：索引表存聚合结果——「每个卖家的订单总金额」「每个类目的销量 Top100」，把归并逻辑也预计算掉。它把 GSI 当流处理的下游：变更日志驱动增量聚合，窗口内可读旧值；收敛需要<strong>幂等 + 可重放</strong>，否则一次重投就把计数算重。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>档位</th>\n<th>索引表内容</th>\n<th>查询跳数</th>\n<th>主流实现</th>\n<th>写放大</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>通道表</td>\n<td><code>(index_key → pk)</code></td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Vitess lookup vindex</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高基数列点查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖索引</td>\n<td>索引键 + 冗余列</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>DynamoDB <code>INCLUDE</code>/<code>ALL</code></td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>列表页、详情页</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物化视图</td>\n<td>预聚合值</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>CDC + 聚合表</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>大盘、排行榜</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三档可叠加：同一业务里，按 <code>merchant_id</code> 的点查用通道表，<code>merchant_id + status</code> 的列表用覆盖索引，销售汇总用物化视图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"写路径与一致性窗口-异步传播下-gsi-什么时候可见\">写路径与一致性窗口：异步传播下 GSI 什么时候可见</h2><p>主表写入到 GSI 可见，中间隔着一个传播链路，按时机分三种：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  W[主表写事务提交] --&gt; M{传播时机}&#10;  M --&gt;|同步 同事务| S[协同提交&lt;br/&gt;跨片 2PC/共识]&#10;  M --&gt;|同步 异构| H[事务内写变更日志&lt;br/&gt;outbox 同库原子]&#10;  M --&gt;|异步| A[CDC 捕获]&#10;  S --&gt; SV[强一致 无窗口]&#10;  H --&gt; HV[原子入队 不丢]&#10;  A --&gt; AV[最终一致&lt;br/&gt;有可见性窗口]&#10;  AV --&gt; R[重试 / 去重 / 顺序]\">flowchart TD\n  W[主表写事务提交] --&gt; M{传播时机}\n  M --&gt;|同步 同事务| S[协同提交&lt;br/&gt;跨片 2PC/共识]\n  M --&gt;|同步 异构| H[事务内写变更日志&lt;br/&gt;outbox 同库原子]\n  M --&gt;|异步| A[CDC 捕获]\n  S --&gt; SV[强一致 无窗口]\n  H --&gt; HV[原子入队 不丢]\n  A --&gt; AV[最终一致&lt;br/&gt;有可见性窗口]\n  AV --&gt; R[重试 / 去重 / 顺序]</pre><p><strong>同步同事务</strong>：GSI 与主表更新放进同一个分布式事务（2PC 或 NewSQL 共识）。窗口为零，代价是写入延迟被跨片协调抬高——参见同 hub 的 <a href=\"distributed-transaction-2pc-tcc-saga\">分布式事务：2PC/TCC/Saga 与最终一致性</a>，只在 GSI 承担强一致读时才值得。</p>\n<p><strong>同步写日志（outbox）</strong>：主表事务里额外插一条变更记录到<strong>同库</strong>的 outbox 表，提交后由独立投递器读 outbox 写入 GSI。outbox 与业务写在同一本地事务保证「不丢」，投递异步保证「不阻塞主链路」（<a href=\"https://microservices.io/patterns/data/transactional-outbox.html\">microservices.io — Transactional Outbox</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>纯异步 CDC</strong>：binlog/WAL 被捕获后发往 GSI，链路最短但对<strong>顺序</strong>最敏感——同一主键的「改 → 删 → 建」若乱序到达，GSI 会收敛到错误终态，因此必须保序，或带<strong>版本号做条件写</strong>（<code>PUT IF version &gt; stored_version</code>）。</p>\n<p>窗口必须量化。设投递失败率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>、重试次数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，则一次写最终未被 GSI 反映的概率上界为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>stale</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{stale}} \\le 1 - (1 - f)^{k+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stale</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f = 10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k = 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>stale</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{stale}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stale</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 约在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 量级——单次不罕见，但配合<strong>对账兜底</strong>（定期比对主表与 GSI 的键集差异并回补）可把残留错误压到可接受范围。结论：窗口不能消除，只能<strong>收敛 + 兜底</strong>，再用读语义隐藏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用读语义掩盖窗口-快照读与读己之写\">用读语义掩盖窗口：快照读与读己之写</h2><p>大多数业务能接受「搜索列表晚 200ms 见到刚下的单」，但<strong>不能</strong>接受「刚创建的资源在搜索里消失，刷新几次又出现」。差异不在窗口长度，而在<strong>单调性</strong>：漂移的窗口会造成「闪烁」。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>盲目读（blind read）</strong>：直接查 GSI，接受任意旧值，适合完全异步的推荐、排行。</li>\n<li><strong>读己之写（read-your-writes）</strong>：先查 GSI，未命中则回主表按主键补查一次；常见做法是写后数秒内对该主键强制回表，救回「写后立刻读」这一最易暴露窗口的场景。</li>\n<li><strong>快照读 / 单调读</strong>：为查询携带<strong>读时间戳</strong>（版本水位），只读取「水位已越过该时间戳」的 GSI 副本。要支持它，GSI 必须记录每条索引项的写入时间，或由协调层维护已追平的主键集合。TiDB 事务级快照读提供了这个水位概念（<a href=\"https://docs.pingcap.com/tidb/stable/transaction-isolation-levels\">docs.pingcap.com — TiDB 事务隔离</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>可落地的折中：<strong>写路径返回变更序号（LSN/version），读路径携带它</strong>，索引消费到该序号即视为可见，否则降级回表。这把窗口精确到「这一个请求的这一个键」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"唯一性约束-跨分片唯一键如何被强制\">唯一性约束：跨分片唯一键如何被强制</h2><p>GSI 上最容易被低估的是 <code>UNIQUE</code>。若 <code>email</code> 是 GSI 键且要求全局唯一，两个分片可能同时观察到「该 email 不存在」并各自插入，全局唯一被破坏——这是分布式系统教科书级的竞态，单靠「先查后插」无法消除。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>一致性</th>\n<th>限制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分片键前缀</td>\n<td>唯一键并入分片键（<code>email</code> 哈希 + <code>user_id</code>）</td>\n<td>强（同片唯一）</td>\n<td>查询必须带完整键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中心仲裁表</td>\n<td>独立分片的唯一键表，写前占位（<code>INSERT</code> 冲突检测）</td>\n<td>强，需分布式事务</td>\n<td>仲裁表成为写热点/单点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共识存储</td>\n<td>唯一键放 etcd/NewSQL 走一次共识</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>每写一次共识，延迟高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异步去重 + 对账</td>\n<td>允许短暂重复，后台合并</td>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n<td>业务需容忍重复窗口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>分片键前缀</strong>是最常见的规避：MongoDB 分片集群要求分片集合上的唯一索引必须<strong>以分片键为前缀</strong>，正因它只在单个分片内能强制唯一（<a href=\"https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/sharded-cluster-requirements/\">mongodb.com — Sharded Cluster Unique Indexes</a>）。若必须同时支持按 email 唯一与点查，务实做法是<strong>中心仲裁 + 异步 GSI</strong>：唯一性由强一致仲裁表保证，查询加速交给异步 GSI。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在线回填与再平衡-gsi-自己的构建与迁移\">在线回填与再平衡：GSI 自己的构建与迁移</h2><p>给已有亿级主表<strong>新增</strong> GSI 不能停业务全量扫描——这正是「双写 + 回填 + 割接」三阶段的用武之地，与主表再平衡同一套方法论，细节见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../rebalancing-consistent-hashing-online-migration/online-resharding-dual-write-backfill-cutover\">在线 Resharding：双写、回填与割接</a>。GSI 语境下有三个专属陷阱：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>回填与增量打架</strong>：回填扫历史数据时增量写入同一主键，两者可能把旧值覆盖新值。解法是回填携带<strong>时间戳/版本</strong>，写 GSI 时做条件写（<code>only if incoming.version &gt;= stored.version</code>）。</li>\n<li><strong>回填限速</strong>：回填扫描会与在线读抢 IO，必须给可调速率上限，并在从库/快照上扫描。</li>\n<li><strong>割接点一致性</strong>：回填完成不等于一致——必须确认「回填水位 ≥ 增量水位」，即所有已发生的写入都被回填覆盖，再切读流量。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>重建 GSI 的另一种做法是<strong>影子索引</strong>：建 <code>gsi_v2</code> 双写新旧，待 v2 追平后原子切换查询路由，v1 保留一段时间作回滚路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"运维与选型清单\">运维与选型清单</h2><p>GSI 上线后真正的运维对象是<strong>窗口</strong>与<strong>成本</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>窗口监控</strong>：采集主表变更时间戳与 GSI 写入时间戳的差（复制延迟 lag），设 P99 阈值告警。lag 突增通常意味着 GSI 分片热点或消费积压。</li>\n<li><strong>对账兜底</strong>：定期比对该 GSI 覆盖键集与主表按该键聚合的键集，差异走回补通道。对账是异步索引的最后一层正确性保证。</li>\n<li><strong>热点治理</strong>：GSI 分片键是索引列，若取值分布极度倾斜（如 <code>status=&#39;pending&#39;</code> 占 90%），GSI 会造出新的热点分片，需给索引键加盐或改复合键。</li>\n<li><strong>写放大核算</strong>：一次主表写入触发 N 个 GSI 各写一次，写吞吐被放大到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(N+1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 量级。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选型准则：<strong>GSI 用「一次查询跳转」换「一条异步链路」</strong>。只有当缺失分片键的查询足够高频、能被 GSI 覆盖，且业务能容纳一致性窗口时，它才优于「改造分片键让查询同片」或「交给搜索/分析存储」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>全局二级索引的本质是<strong>用一张派生表把跨分片查询降级为单分片查询</strong>，其工程难度全部集中在：主表与派生表是两套分片规则，同步只能是异步的，异步就必然有窗口。三条判断线贯穿全文——建什么形态（通道表 / 覆盖索引 / 物化视图）取决于查询形状；怎么维护（同步共识 / outbox / CDC）取决于一致性要求与写延迟预算；怎么掩盖窗口（快照读 / 读己之写 / 对账）取决于业务的单调性需求。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"全局二级索引建模与异步一致性维护","id":"全局二级索引建模与异步一致性维护"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：局部索引的边界与全局索引的代价","id":"核心概念-局部索引的边界与全局索引的代价"},{"level":2,"text":"三种建模范式：通道表、覆盖索引表与物化视图","id":"三种建模范式-通道表-覆盖索引表与物化视图"},{"level":2,"text":"写路径与一致性窗口：异步传播下 GSI 什么时候可见","id":"写路径与一致性窗口-异步传播下-gsi-什么时候可见"},{"level":2,"text":"用读语义掩盖窗口：快照读与读己之写","id":"用读语义掩盖窗口-快照读与读己之写"},{"level":2,"text":"唯一性约束：跨分片唯一键如何被强制","id":"唯一性约束-跨分片唯一键如何被强制"},{"level":2,"text":"在线回填与再平衡：GSI 自己的构建与迁移","id":"在线回填与再平衡-gsi-自己的构建与迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"运维与选型清单","id":"运维与选型清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分布式事务：2PC/TCC/Saga 与最终一致性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/relational-database-sharding-distributed-scaling/crossshard-query-distributed-transaction/distributed-transaction-2pc-tcc-saga"},"next":{"title":"NewSQL/HTAP 架构原理与选型对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/relational-database-sharding-distributed-scaling/newsql-htap-middleware-operations/newsql-htap-architecture-comparison"}}